{
  "id": "js-mixed",
  "dangerouslyAllowJS": true,
  "title": "JS Mixed: Calculations + Conditions",
  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "page-1",
      "fields": [
        {
          "id": "intro",
          "fieldType": "html",
          "htmlContent": "<h2 style='margin:0 0 8px'>JS Mixed Test Suite</h2><p>Tests <strong>both</strong> features together: a <code>calculation</code> derives a value, and a <code>conditionType: 'js'</code> condition reacts to that derived value — forming a two-stage JS pipeline. Also covers mixed rule logic (JS condition combined with field/expression condition in the same rule).</p>",
          "iframeHeight": 110
        },
        {
